WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:32.299
"My Rival and Me"

3
00:32.300 --> 00:34.300
(Episode 5)

4
00:43.320 --> 00:46.320
Aren't these offerings a little strange?

5
00:48.550 --> 00:51.150
[Guanyin, the Goddess of Mercy, grants all requests for children.]

6
00:53.240 --> 00:56.159
Is it really appropriate for us to pray here?

7
00:56.759 --> 00:58.000
Well, we're here already.

8
00:58.079 --> 01:00.280
It's the New Year. Everyone's got it tough.

9
01:01.000 --> 01:02.000
Ah.

10
01:02.280 --> 01:04.000
The three great Chinese virtues.

11
01:24.000 --> 01:28.938
Goddess Guanyin, please bless Lan Jue, the drama Gu Yiliang and I are in.

12
01:29.126 --> 01:34.404
We've poured so much into this production. It's like our own child.

13
01:34.429 --> 01:38.596
Please let filming go smoothly and make it a hit.

14
01:47.480 --> 01:49.319
What did you wish for?

15
01:49.640 --> 01:50.840
I wished that tomorrow's lunch

16
01:51.000 --> 01:52.599
won't have twice-cooked pork again.

17
01:54.439 --> 01:55.560
That's all you wished for?

18
01:55.760 --> 01:56.760
When you make a wish,

19
01:56.959 --> 01:58.959
you wish for whatever matters most right now.

20
01:59.159 --> 02:01.239
I've had that dish four days in a row.

21
02:01.519 --> 02:02.319
If I keep eating it,

22
02:02.439 --> 02:04.040
my tongue will be twice-cooked too.

23
02:04.719 --> 02:06.040
What about you?

24
02:06.120 --> 02:07.120
What did you wish for?

25
02:10.080 --> 02:11.439
It won't come true if I tell you.

26
02:17.120 --> 02:20.479
Oh, that smile. I love it.

27
02:29.560 --> 02:31.560
Oh, right. You still haven't told me

28
02:31.759 --> 02:33.759
why you thought I was unhappy.

29
02:34.759 --> 02:36.840
It's... nothing.

30
02:38.039 --> 02:39.960
I remember you saying you're a theory guy.

31
02:40.080 --> 02:42.599
Acting takes observation of real life.

32
02:43.039 --> 02:44.758
Without life experience,

33
02:44.759 --> 02:46.759
your acting will seem very unnatural.

34
02:50.319 --> 02:51.679
Why bring that up all of a sudden?

35
02:52.280 --> 02:54.280
Because you've been acting unnatural all day.

36
02:54.360 --> 02:56.056
It wasn't until I saw you smile at the temple

37
02:56.080 --> 02:57.319
that you seemed like yourself.

38
02:58.039 --> 02:59.199
I have good reason to suspect

39
02:59.400 --> 03:01.479
you've been studying something behind my back.

40
03:05.000 --> 03:06.960
You haven't been reading novels, have you?

41
03:11.520 --> 03:13.400
I don't know why you're reading them,

42
03:13.719 --> 03:15.199
but you don't have to copy anyone.

43
03:15.759 --> 03:17.039
You're already great as you are.

44
03:17.919 --> 03:18.599
Let's go.

45
03:18.800 --> 03:20.080
We still have lines to rehearse.

46
03:57.280 --> 03:58.599
Looks like

47
03:58.680 --> 04:00.800
I need a whole new kind of sugar-daddy arrangement

48
04:00.879 --> 04:03.280
to protect him properly.

49
04:03.360 --> 04:04.360
Mm.

50
04:05.159 --> 04:07.280
A healthy sugar-daddy model for the new century.

51
04:08.280 --> 04:11.360
We need moral, intellectual and physical growth.

52
04:12.080 --> 04:13.080
Mm.

53
04:23.279 --> 04:24.319
Mr. Gu?

54
04:24.879 --> 04:25.879
What brings you here?

55
04:32.560 --> 04:33.959
This... is for you.

56
04:34.439 --> 04:35.679
Take a look when you have time.

57
04:39.269 --> 04:40.429
[Self-improvement for Actors]

58
04:41.879 --> 04:43.199
Instead of sleeping at this hour,

59
04:43.480 --> 04:45.319
he's worrying that I'm too uncultured?

60
04:47.000 --> 04:48.480
I don't care about dignity.

61
04:48.879 --> 04:50.279
I don't care about pride.

62
04:51.120 --> 04:52.279
All I want is you.

63
04:53.040 --> 04:55.160
We may start out with nothing,

64
04:55.480 --> 04:56.199
but

65
04:56.360 --> 04:57.560
I believe in you.

66
04:58.399 --> 05:00.120
We'll always be together.

67
05:00.839 --> 05:01.839
You.

68
05:03.120 --> 05:04.120
Only you.

69
05:06.839 --> 05:08.838
Oh, my dear friend.

70
05:08.839 --> 05:10.720
Oh, my esteemed boss.

71
05:11.040 --> 05:12.800
Reviewing your past performances

72
05:12.879 --> 05:14.680
is another way to learn.

73
05:15.279 --> 05:18.160
Your earlier acting was a little stiff, though.

74
05:18.480 --> 05:19.480
Stiff?

75
05:21.160 --> 05:22.879
Forced.

76
05:23.000 --> 05:24.000
Forced?

77
05:25.720 --> 05:26.720
Unpolished.

78
05:26.800 --> 05:27.800
Unpolished?

79
05:29.839 --> 05:31.879
Mr. Gu, please stop trying to comfort me.

80
05:32.120 --> 05:34.800
I know exactly how good I am.

81
05:35.120 --> 05:37.279
Please... spare me.

82
05:38.079 --> 05:39.079
It's all right.

83
05:39.680 --> 05:41.480
Let's watch your earlier work.

84
05:43.439 --> 05:44.560
Back when I was a student,

85
05:44.759 --> 05:46.959
I thought the law protected people too.

86
05:47.720 --> 05:48.319
Huh?

87
05:48.480 --> 05:51.279
I think Zhang sent the wrong edit.

88
05:51.480 --> 05:52.360
Never mind that.

89
05:52.439 --> 05:53.560
I've seen this drama.

90
05:54.920 --> 05:56.240
Once I entered the real world,

91
05:56.399 --> 05:57.480
I realized

92
05:58.600 --> 06:00.120
it was all fucking bullshit.

93
06:00.560 --> 06:02.360
The law only protects the rich.

94
06:03.000 --> 06:04.040
The truly poor

95
06:04.680 --> 06:06.759
can't even afford a copy of the Constitution.

96
06:08.240 --> 06:09.240
Your Honor,

97
06:10.399 --> 06:12.359
how do you expect the old, weak, sick and disabled

98
06:12.680 --> 06:15.079
to get back the money that's rightfully theirs?

99
06:16.480 --> 06:17.878
At the heart of this character

100
06:17.879 --> 06:20.839
is a young man's idealism shattered by reality.

101
06:20.959 --> 06:23.720
He can't be truly good, but he's not entirely bad either.

102
06:24.000 --> 06:26.198
So when you played him,

103
06:26.199 --> 06:28.600
you didn't explode or break down.

104
06:28.839 --> 06:30.399
You made it a confession instead,

105
06:30.480 --> 06:32.319
letting the audience feel his remorse.

106
06:32.439 --> 06:33.439
Am I right?

107
06:34.879 --> 06:35.879
Yes.

108
06:35.920 --> 06:38.719
This is a classic clip in the Niangzi fans' tragic edits.

109
06:38.720 --> 06:40.920
I know it inside out.

110
06:44.920 --> 06:46.040
Hey, Mr. Gu.

111
06:46.160 --> 06:47.415
Where are you going? Aren't we studying?

112
06:47.439 --> 06:49.160
No... no need. You're very good.

113
06:49.199 --> 06:50.199
Hey, Gu...

114
06:53.720 --> 06:56.120
Why the hell are you blushing?

115
07:03.399 --> 07:05.720
An all-night shoot, and now tennis after wrap?

116
07:06.560 --> 07:08.480
What an energetic day.

117
07:08.680 --> 07:10.199
Filming keeps us working nonstop.

118
07:10.319 --> 07:12.319
A little exercise helps relieve stress.

119
07:13.639 --> 07:14.639
Fancy a game?

120
07:14.720 --> 07:15.759
You're on.

121
07:27.439 --> 07:28.480
I'm warning you,

122
07:28.879 --> 07:31.399
I'm a man destined to be the Prince of Tennis.

123
07:32.160 --> 07:33.360
That good, huh?

124
07:33.680 --> 07:35.079
I'd better watch out, then.

125
07:36.540 --> 07:40.120
At this distance, I should be able to resist him, right?

126
07:46.040 --> 07:48.399
You can't return my serve.

127
07:59.319 --> 08:01.519
Damn it! I wasn't ready!

128
08:01.560 --> 08:03.519
That wasn't my real serve.

129
08:06.759 --> 08:09.399
This is my real serve.

130
08:20.920 --> 08:22.079
This side feels awkward.

131
08:22.279 --> 08:23.279
Let's switch sides.

132
08:25.000 --> 08:26.000
Okay.

133
08:44.960 --> 08:46.360
Just you wait, Gu Yiliang.

134
08:55.879 --> 08:58.440
Gu Yiliang, I'll battle you till dawn!

135
09:02.240 --> 09:03.240
Again!

136
09:04.440 --> 09:07.320
No more. No more.

137
09:07.519 --> 09:10.039
I need... a ventilator.

138
09:13.679 --> 09:14.679
All right.

139
09:24.480 --> 09:26.120
Yes! I won! I won!

140
09:26.200 --> 09:28.360
I won! I won!

141
09:28.440 --> 09:30.120
Gu Yiliang, I won!

142
09:30.200 --> 09:31.200
Yeah!

143
09:36.700 --> 09:39.132
So distance has nothing to do with it.

144
09:42.025 --> 09:43.025
That's a wrap!

145
09:45.440 --> 09:47.399
I'm exhausted.

146
09:48.320 --> 09:49.320
Oh, Lucas.

147
09:49.600 --> 09:51.080
Tomorrow's call sheet is out.

148
09:51.120 --> 09:52.456
We need the early morning light for some shots,

149
09:52.480 --> 09:53.760
so please come early for makeup.

150
09:53.840 --> 09:54.320
Okay.

151
09:54.399 --> 09:55.816
I'll stay at the crew's hotel tonight.

152
09:55.840 --> 09:56.639
I definitely won't be late.

153
09:56.759 --> 09:57.320
Great.

154
09:57.360 --> 09:58.655
It's already late. Get some rest.

155
09:58.679 --> 09:59.679
Okay.

156
10:07.879 --> 10:09.919
You're done filming, right?

157
10:10.080 --> 10:11.279
It's late.

158
10:11.960 --> 10:13.320
What can I do for you, Mr. Cheng?

159
10:14.519 --> 10:16.559
When are you coming home?

160
10:16.759 --> 10:17.855
I'm not coming back tonight.

161
10:17.879 --> 10:18.639
Tomorrow morning...

162
10:18.640 --> 10:20.080
I'm not feeling well.

163
10:22.720 --> 10:23.559
Not feeling well?

164
10:23.600 --> 10:24.919
Why don't you see a doctor?

165
10:25.000 --> 10:26.639
I only want to see you.

166
10:31.759 --> 10:32.440
Okay.

167
10:32.639 --> 10:33.639
I'll be right there.

168
10:44.080 --> 10:45.080
Cheng Yan?

169
10:46.399 --> 10:47.399
Cheng Yan?

170
10:51.639 --> 10:53.120
Where are you?

171
11:16.120 --> 11:17.120
What are you doing?

172
11:18.039 --> 11:19.840
Isn't this why you called me back?

173
11:20.279 --> 11:21.279
The contract says

174
11:21.440 --> 11:22.879
I have to come whenever you call.

175
11:23.039 --> 11:25.440
Next time, don't bother pretending to be sick.

176
11:27.000 --> 11:28.200
Do you regret it?

177
11:29.080 --> 11:30.080
No.

178
11:30.440 --> 11:31.480
I chose this.

179
11:33.799 --> 11:34.799
Let's get on with it.

180
11:35.320 --> 11:37.120
I still have to get back to the set afterward.

181
11:39.200 --> 11:40.200
You can go.

182
11:42.399 --> 11:43.399
What do you mean?

183
11:43.879 --> 11:45.159
Are you fucking messing with me?

184
11:46.240 --> 11:47.240
Yes.

185
11:47.399 --> 11:48.399
I'm messing with you.

186
11:48.759 --> 11:50.200
It's your fault for falling for it.

187
11:55.480 --> 11:56.639
You're sick.

188
12:41.600 --> 12:43.600
Here, have some water.

189
12:44.639 --> 12:46.399
You worked hard just now.

190
12:46.519 --> 12:47.600
Have some of this.

191
12:52.440 --> 12:53.639
It's all right, Zhu Mingming.

192
12:54.600 --> 12:56.200
So what if I had to fall into the water?

193
12:56.639 --> 12:58.119
So what if I don't have an assistant?

194
12:58.519 --> 13:00.200
As long as I can keep playing this role,

195
13:00.639 --> 13:01.639
that's good enough.

196
13:02.240 --> 13:03.240
Keep going.

197
13:09.759 --> 13:10.759
Here.

198
13:17.879 --> 13:18.879
Lucas.

199
13:19.039 --> 13:19.879
I just heard

200
13:20.000 --> 13:21.639
your real name is Zhu Mingming, right?

201
13:22.840 --> 13:24.280
Can I call you Mingming from now on?

202
13:24.440 --> 13:25.120
Sure.

203
13:25.240 --> 13:26.655
Remember to take a shower when you get back,

204
13:26.679 --> 13:28.320
and change into clean clothes.

205
13:28.840 --> 13:29.279
Okay.

206
13:29.320 --> 13:29.759
I'm off.

207
13:29.799 --> 13:30.799
Thank you.

208
13:49.080 --> 13:50.200
Yanyan, come and eat.

209
13:50.399 --> 13:51.879
The food Mr. Gu ordered is delicious.

210
13:52.919 --> 13:54.039
He ordered this?

211
13:54.200 --> 13:54.840
Yes.

212
13:54.919 --> 13:57.600
But yours looks different from mine.

213
13:58.720 --> 14:00.759
Maybe Mr. Gu wanted to treat you,

214
14:00.840 --> 14:02.135
so he ordered food for the whole crew.

215
14:02.159 --> 14:03.000
No way.

216
14:03.080 --> 14:05.400
He probably ordered two kinds and handed them out randomly.

217
14:11.399 --> 14:12.399
I'm too annoyed to eat.

218
14:14.639 --> 14:15.639
Hmph.

219
14:18.159 --> 14:19.159
Mr. Gu.

220
14:19.440 --> 14:20.440
How does it taste?

221
14:20.639 --> 14:21.639
I haven't tried it yet.

222
14:22.399 --> 14:23.440
Go on, eat.

223
14:34.279 --> 14:35.279
Mm.

224
14:35.360 --> 14:37.759
That's quite a special meal you ordered.

225
14:40.120 --> 14:41.240
I made it myself.

226
14:51.679 --> 14:53.239
Have you drunk from this bottle before?

227
14:54.080 --> 14:54.600
No.

228
14:54.840 --> 14:56.840
Chen brought it over. He said it was from a fan.

229
14:57.799 --> 14:59.120
This bottle has been opened.

230
14:59.799 --> 15:02.240
Don't touch anything with a broken seal from now on.

231
15:02.440 --> 15:05.120
Some fans put things in your food and water.

232
15:06.200 --> 15:07.200
Got it.

233
15:08.120 --> 15:09.240
I'll get you another bottle.

234
15:10.039 --> 15:11.039
I swallowed it.

235
15:15.080 --> 15:16.360
Oh, wow! Wow!

236
15:16.399 --> 15:18.639
The Best Actor Top and His Pretty Bottom, Part Two.

237
15:18.720 --> 15:19.720
A masterpiece.

238
15:20.159 --> 15:22.519
Let me appreciate this.

239
15:31.240 --> 15:32.960
Let me savor it.

240
15:40.799 --> 15:42.200
Why does this cushion

241
15:42.399 --> 15:43.759
feel less comfortable than before?

242
15:44.879 --> 15:48.519
Some stalker fans might put things in your food and water.

243
16:05.759 --> 16:06.759
Huh?

244
16:08.039 --> 16:09.039
What the hell?

245
16:09.480 --> 16:11.080
Where's my two-thousand-yuan face cream?

246
16:13.799 --> 16:14.519
Hello, Yanyan?

247
16:14.600 --> 16:15.960
I brought your favorite milk tea.

248
16:17.080 --> 16:17.679
Mr. Gu.

249
16:17.879 --> 16:18.360
Done filming?

250
16:18.440 --> 16:19.440
Mm.

251
16:19.840 --> 16:21.840
I only brought one serving today.

252
16:23.879 --> 16:24.879
What?

253
16:25.440 --> 16:26.440
Something's missing?

254
16:26.759 --> 16:27.759
That doesn't seem likely.

255
16:28.559 --> 16:29.360
Don't panic.

256
16:29.399 --> 16:30.960
I'm in the parking lot right now.

257
16:31.320 --> 16:33.040
Ask reception to check the security footage.

258
16:34.360 --> 16:34.919
Wei Yanzi,

259
16:35.120 --> 16:36.559
are you alone in your room?

260
16:38.799 --> 16:40.375
Make sure all the doors and windows are shut.

261
16:40.399 --> 16:41.439
Lock the door from inside.

262
16:41.480 --> 16:42.520
I'm coming over right now.

263
16:42.559 --> 16:43.559
Okay?

264
16:44.279 --> 16:44.879
What's wrong?

265
16:45.039 --> 16:46.320
Yanyan's got a stalker fan.

266
16:46.559 --> 16:47.559
What?

267
16:48.039 --> 16:49.399
Come on! Hurry, hurry!

268
16:55.480 --> 16:56.480
Yanyan!

269
16:56.559 --> 16:57.759
Stop filming! Stop filming!

270
16:57.879 --> 16:59.000
Stop filming! Stop filming!

271
16:59.360 --> 17:00.120
Stop filming!

272
17:00.240 --> 17:01.240
Stop filming!

273
17:08.680 --> 17:10.079
Mr. Gu, your key card.

274
17:24.559 --> 17:25.559
Mr. Gu.

275
17:26.000 --> 17:27.000
Let's talk inside.

276
17:34.400 --> 17:35.200
Mr. Gu,

277
17:35.279 --> 17:36.376
it's really nothing serious.

278
17:36.400 --> 17:37.480
Sorry you had to rush over.

279
17:37.680 --> 17:38.680
Thank you.

280
17:38.720 --> 17:39.720
Between the two of us,

281
17:39.799 --> 17:40.879
there's no need for thanks.

282
17:46.039 --> 17:47.640
Go inside. Go inside.

283
17:50.200 --> 17:50.720
We've got a problem.

284
17:50.920 --> 17:52.255
A lot of stalker fans have shown up downstairs.

285
17:52.279 --> 17:53.416
Security is trying to stop them,

286
17:53.440 --> 17:55.319
but a few may have got up the stairs.

287
17:55.480 --> 17:56.160
What?

288
17:56.319 --> 17:58.039
The hotel information must have been leaked.

289
17:58.319 --> 17:58.839
Chen,

290
17:59.039 --> 18:00.559
ask the company to send more security.

291
18:00.640 --> 18:01.240
As soon as possible.

292
18:01.359 --> 18:02.359
Okay.

293
18:07.160 --> 18:08.480
If they got into your room,

294
18:08.720 --> 18:10.000
they must have your key card.

295
18:10.200 --> 18:11.440
It's not safe to stay here.

296
18:14.160 --> 18:15.160
Yanyan,

297
18:15.720 --> 18:16.720
do you trust me?

298
18:20.079 --> 18:21.279
Are you sure it's this floor?

299
18:21.519 --> 18:23.535
What did the person who sold you the information say?

300
18:23.559 --> 18:26.119
He just said somewhere between floors fifteen and twenty.

301
18:26.319 --> 18:27.839
For the exact room number,

302
18:27.920 --> 18:29.095
I'd have to pay another thirty thousand yuan.

303
18:29.119 --> 18:30.480
Thirty thousand?

304
18:30.680 --> 18:32.280
That wouldn't even cover a photo for me.

305
18:32.640 --> 18:34.400
Forget it. Let's just stake it out ourselves.

306
18:34.920 --> 18:36.839
We might even catch Gu Yiliang.

307
18:37.079 --> 18:37.960
I don't ship those two.

308
18:38.039 --> 18:40.119
Two straight guys faking it. It's forced and cringey.

309
18:41.480 --> 18:42.480
Not this way.

310
18:43.119 --> 18:45.160
You say that, but you still came with me.

311
18:49.759 --> 18:51.119
Good thing you reacted so quickly.

312
18:51.880 --> 18:53.240
We can't stay here forever.

313
18:53.480 --> 18:54.520
Let's head upstairs first.

314
19:08.559 --> 19:09.559
I can't.

315
19:09.599 --> 19:10.599
I'm exhausted.

316
19:10.839 --> 19:11.839
I need to sit down.

317
19:12.160 --> 19:13.160
Otherwise,

318
19:13.200 --> 19:15.000
I'll need a wheelchair to get to set tomorrow.

319
19:16.119 --> 19:17.839
I could carry you to work on my back.

320
19:19.599 --> 19:20.680
Sounds lovely.

321
19:21.279 --> 19:23.839
Remember that livestream when you stood in the center by mistake?

322
19:24.079 --> 19:26.119
They said you disrespected the senior actor there.

323
19:26.279 --> 19:27.000
That day,

324
19:27.200 --> 19:30.079
I was offering incense at Nanpu Temple, two thousand kilometers away.

325
19:30.279 --> 19:31.640
Some haters took photos of me

326
19:31.799 --> 19:34.559
and said I was casting a curse on you from afar.

327
19:35.319 --> 19:36.319
So, my rival,

328
19:36.759 --> 19:38.519
if anything really happens to me,

329
19:39.160 --> 19:40.759
you'll be the prime suspect.

330
19:41.640 --> 19:43.400
So we've been inseparable

331
19:44.599 --> 19:45.640
since way back then.

332
19:47.518 --> 19:50.713
So this is where the sweet stuff is!

333
19:57.799 --> 19:59.680
Oh, I'm not cold.

334
20:01.160 --> 20:02.360
I'm hot from all that running.

335
20:05.079 --> 20:09.112
How are you so good at giving shippers sweet moments? How are your romantic moves so advanced?

336
20:21.086 --> 20:25.965
The fanfics really had it right. At a time like this, a third wheel is bound to show up.

337
20:31.039 --> 20:32.039
Hello?

338
20:32.839 --> 20:33.839
Got it.

339
20:34.039 --> 20:34.599
Okay.

340
20:34.960 --> 20:35.960
Bye.

341
20:40.319 --> 20:41.639
Chen just told me

342
20:41.640 --> 20:44.055
the stalker who stole my key card was taken away by the police.

343
20:44.079 --> 20:45.920
The others have all been sent away too.

344
20:46.400 --> 20:48.880
The hotel manager and the security team Mr. Cheng hired

345
20:49.079 --> 20:51.480
will thoroughly check the hotel tonight.

346
20:52.440 --> 20:54.200
You should still stay somewhere else tonight.

347
20:54.480 --> 20:56.320
It's hard to find a place at this hour, though.

348
20:56.720 --> 20:57.920
And there's the privacy issue.

349
20:59.079 --> 21:00.440
You've got a point.

350
21:01.680 --> 21:02.799
Then how about your place?

351
21:03.039 --> 21:04.599
I could see the cat too.

352
21:09.640 --> 21:11.960
Unless it's inconvenient.

353
21:13.039 --> 21:14.039
Sure.

354
21:14.079 --> 21:15.079
It's fine.

355
21:16.000 --> 21:17.000
To see the cat.

356
21:17.240 --> 21:17.720
Okay.

357
21:17.759 --> 21:19.000
I'll let Chen know.

358
21:21.119 --> 21:22.119
To see the cat.

359
21:26.000 --> 21:27.000
Understood.

360
21:27.279 --> 21:29.759
Have the hotel move them to another floor after the inspection.

361
21:29.960 --> 21:31.000
And arrange more security.

362
21:44.160 --> 21:45.400
Oh, Lucas.

363
21:45.759 --> 21:46.759
Why are you still here?

364
21:47.640 --> 21:49.200
I'm waiting for my night scene.

365
21:50.920 --> 21:51.960
That scene was cut.

366
21:53.000 --> 21:54.480
They must have forgotten to tell you.

367
21:56.000 --> 21:57.480
I see. Thank you.

368
21:57.640 --> 21:58.880
No problem. It's getting late.

369
21:58.920 --> 21:59.799
You should head back soon.

370
21:59.799 --> 22:00.079
Okay.

371
22:00.080 --> 22:01.255
It's hard to get a cab this late.

372
22:01.279 --> 22:02.079
I'm heading off. Bye.

373
22:02.119 --> 22:03.119
Okay.

374
22:13.039 --> 22:14.039
Mingming.

375
22:20.119 --> 22:22.240
Why isn't he saying anything?

376
22:24.493 --> 22:27.759
Quiet. So quiet. Way too quiet.

377
22:28.000 --> 22:29.136
Even my veins aren't this still.

378
22:29.160 --> 22:30.440
Even Shizuka isn't this quiet.

379
22:30.599 --> 22:32.136
Even Jingtai District isn't this quiet.

380
22:32.160 --> 22:34.480
Even calming tonic isn't this calming.

381
22:35.079 --> 22:36.759
How about some music?

382
22:39.440 --> 22:43.585
I love you, my dear Gu Yiliang.

383
22:44.920 --> 22:47.720
Silence is nice, actually.

384
22:49.579 --> 22:53.266
It's been so long. Why hasn't he said anything?

385
22:53.558 --> 22:56.759
Why does he still look so nervous?

386
22:59.680 --> 23:01.279
Why do I feel like

387
23:01.359 --> 23:03.440
we keep going in circles?

388
23:05.720 --> 23:07.240
I need to get some things for home.

389
23:07.920 --> 23:09.400
I'm looking for somewhere on the way.

390
23:12.440 --> 23:13.000
A supermarket.

391
23:13.279 --> 23:14.279
A supermarket?

392
23:15.240 --> 23:16.519
There's one just ahead.

393
23:16.640 --> 23:18.519
We've already passed it three times.

394
23:28.799 --> 23:30.559
I'll get it. Wait in the car.

395
23:38.480 --> 23:41.440
What is he buying? He's acting so strange.

396
24:01.920 --> 24:03.039
Yes, that's just right.

397
24:09.279 --> 24:10.279
Watch where you're going.

398
24:18.680 --> 24:20.599
Take me with you when you eat from now on.

399
24:20.880 --> 24:22.320
I'll help you finish the other half.

400
24:22.880 --> 24:23.880
Sure.

401
24:25.640 --> 24:26.640
What did you say?

402
24:27.240 --> 24:28.240
I didn't catch that.

403
24:29.680 --> 24:31.319
It looks like you've got heat rash.

404
24:31.519 --> 24:32.839
I brought you some talcum powder.

405
24:33.359 --> 24:34.679
You don't have to force yourself.

406
24:35.160 --> 24:36.160
I'm not.

407
24:36.786 --> 24:37.786
It's settled, then.

408
24:39.079 --> 24:40.159
I'll come over from now on.

409
24:40.479 --> 24:41.479
Come to my place.

410
24:42.720 --> 24:43.720
It's safer here.

411
24:47.519 --> 24:48.519
So, my rival,

412
24:49.693 --> 24:51.372
why are you so protective of me?

413
24:53.946 --> 24:55.146
I'd like to ask you that too.

414
24:55.706 --> 24:57.186
Why am I so protective of you?

415
24:57.680 --> 24:58.680
Hey, rival.

416
25:02.326 --> 25:05.406
[What should happen will happen, what should make you feel will make you feel]

417
25:41.160 --> 25:42.160
Got everything?

418
25:45.599 --> 25:48.279
That's all? Why was he so nervous, then?

419
25:51.079 --> 25:52.079
Let's go.

420
25:58.319 --> 26:00.359
Continue straight ahead.

421
26:05.680 --> 26:07.359
What's going on?

422
26:07.440 --> 26:09.640
Why isn't Gu Yiliang nervous anymore,

423
26:09.720 --> 26:11.720
but now I am?

424
26:16.520 --> 26:18.720
What exactly is he planning?

425
26:18.799 --> 26:20.559
This isn't the road home.

426
26:20.640 --> 26:24.758
This is clearly the road to... to...

427
26:32.240 --> 26:34.680
Follow the bend ahead.

428
26:51.799 --> 26:52.799
Come in.

429
26:53.720 --> 26:56.372
Have I... gone gay?

430
26:57.960 --> 26:58.960
Come on in.

431
26:59.559 --> 27:00.559
Oh.

432
27:01.920 --> 27:02.720
Have a seat.

433
27:02.839 --> 27:03.960
I'll get some fruit.

434
27:04.279 --> 27:05.279
Ah.

435
27:12.200 --> 27:13.480
No way. No way.

436
27:13.519 --> 27:15.000
I'm a straight man.

437
27:19.680 --> 27:21.119
"Give Me the Time of a Song,"

438
27:21.200 --> 27:24.119
some invisible hands have dragged me out of the closet.

439
27:24.200 --> 27:26.640
No way. Absolutely not.

440
27:37.640 --> 27:39.696
Am I crazy? Why am I already assuming I'm the bottom?

441
27:39.720 --> 27:40.960
If anything, I'd be the top.

442
27:43.559 --> 27:45.160
Wait, why am I assuming I'm gay at all?

443
27:45.240 --> 27:46.519
Wei Yanzi, calm down.

444
27:46.599 --> 27:49.039
I can't lose my head at a time like this.

445
28:12.319 --> 28:13.319
Gu Yiliang.

446
28:14.599 --> 28:16.240
My rival has made his feelings clear.

447
28:18.920 --> 28:20.039
I can't back down now.

448
28:25.130 --> 28:26.610
[Bonus Content: Gu Yiliang's Diary 2]

449
28:26.880 --> 28:29.039
Douya, make a note of this.

450
28:30.039 --> 28:31.559
Today, my rival told me...

451
28:33.880 --> 28:35.039
I'm already great as I am.

452
28:35.519 --> 28:36.519
Oh my God.

453
28:36.542 --> 28:39.857
Hearing a rival say you're great as you are is really affecting.

454
28:40.099 --> 28:43.379
That recognition means even more than becoming friends.

455
28:43.640 --> 28:45.559
And yet I've become his sugar daddy.

456
28:46.759 --> 28:48.159
In my three years in this industry,

457
28:48.799 --> 28:52.079
I've done all I can to avoid its shady arrangements.

458
28:53.000 --> 28:54.079
I never imagined...

459
28:55.279 --> 28:56.720
I'd end up keeping someone myself.

460
28:58.079 --> 28:59.279
My sincere advice:

461
28:59.720 --> 29:02.799
end this transactional relationship as soon as possible.

462
29:02.920 --> 29:04.039
Maintain your integrity.

463
29:05.079 --> 29:06.079
Impossible.

464
29:06.759 --> 29:09.200
This wasn't an impulsive decision.

465
29:09.599 --> 29:11.960
I carefully thought it over for three cigarettes.

466
29:14.160 --> 29:15.160
During the first,

467
29:17.599 --> 29:18.720
I really did hesitate.

468
29:19.160 --> 29:22.640
But my rival looked at me with such trust

469
29:23.079 --> 29:24.480
that I simply couldn't reject

470
29:24.880 --> 29:26.559
the trust he placed in me.

471
29:31.000 --> 29:32.039
During the second,

472
29:33.480 --> 29:37.079
I assessed my finances and connections.

473
29:38.079 --> 29:39.079
I thought.

474
29:39.720 --> 29:41.080
I could give him something better.

475
29:42.279 --> 29:43.319
No question about that.

476
29:45.640 --> 29:46.640
During the third,

477
29:47.599 --> 29:48.720
I considered

478
29:50.480 --> 29:51.960
what would happen to our relationship

479
29:52.160 --> 29:55.680
if it were discovered and exposed.

480
29:57.359 --> 29:58.799
Actually, nothing much would happen.

481
30:00.440 --> 30:03.359
We could pass it off as promoting our on-screen pairing.

482
30:04.200 --> 30:05.279
If we really got exposed,

483
30:05.880 --> 30:07.560
we'd cross that bridge when we came to it.

484
30:08.079 --> 30:09.079
Right?

485
30:09.440 --> 30:13.920
Conclusion: improper smoking leads to moral decline.

486
30:17.240 --> 30:19.480
I'm supposed to be his sugar daddy,

487
30:20.319 --> 30:23.358
but he won't take the opportunities I offer, or my gifts.

488
30:23.599 --> 30:26.039
He even insists on splitting the assistant's salary evenly.

489
30:29.880 --> 30:31.319
Today, he even said...

490
30:32.200 --> 30:34.839
I'm already great as I am.

491
30:37.519 --> 30:38.519
Tell me,

492
30:39.599 --> 30:40.880
should I kiss him?

493
30:43.920 --> 30:46.480
Would you like me to use your search history

494
30:46.559 --> 30:49.680
to recommend some new fanfic collections?

495
30:51.559 --> 30:52.559
No.
